# Where AI Can't Replace Human Care in Health

A small educational website about the role of human connection in health care and the limits of AI. The site uses Python's standard library to serve HTML, CSS, and JavaScript; it does not use Streamlit or require third-party packages.

## Run it

```bash
python Website.py
```

Then open [http://127.0.0.1:8000](http://127.0.0.1:8000) in a browser. Stop the server with Ctrl+C. The scenario sorter and quiz save progress in browser storage, and the reflection tool uses local rule-based logic without an external API.

Educational only. This site is not medical advice.
